    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0011:0001",
      "blockId": "blockquote:discussion:0011",
      "type": "blockquote",
      "source": "**Note**: Unlike [`PhysicallyBasedMaterial`](physicallybasedmaterial.md), [`CustomMaterial`](custommaterial.md) has no [`emissiveIntensity`](physicallybasedmaterial/emissiveintensity.md) value.",
